, as if inviting a weary traveler to rest.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_162","a","003",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",1.0],["say","0","The knight never sleeps in the bed. She is used to dozing off against its edge. That bed...==W== It's reserved for someone. Someone important to her.",0,""],["w",0.5],["goon"],["se","se_025_stop"],["w",0.5],["trn",0,0,true,true,0.75],["w",0.75],["bg","phylanis_street_outside_night",0,0.0],["stg",0,0.0,0.0,1.0,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["cbg",0,0.0,0.0,1.5,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["w",0.5],["trn",1,0,false,false,0.75],["w",1.25],["se","se_062"],["show","avg1_162","a","002",0.53,null,0.97,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg1_162","a",null,null,0.5,null,1.0,1.0,null,"OutQuad",0.5],["say","0","The knight picks up her longsword and steps out of the cramped insula, bathed in cold starlight.",0,""],["w",0.5],["bgm","m163"],["cbg",0,300.0,null,1.3,"Linear",18.0,null,null,null],["ctl","avg1_162","a",null,null,0.4,null,1.02,null,"manbu_loop","Linear",18.0],["say","0","The Filanis of today no longer needs her night patrols.",0,""],["w",0.5],["say","0","Young citizens have joined the Night Watchers, taking daily shifts to guard the city that belongs to them.",0,""],["w",0.5],["say","0","Yet she still leaves the house at this hour out of habit, stepping into the empty lot beside the insula.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_162","a",null,null,null,null,null,0.0,"stop","OutQuad",1.0],["hide","avg1_162",1.0],["bg","sky_night_b",0,1.0],["cbg",0,null,-80.0,null,"OutQuad",1.0,null,null,null],["w",2.0],["se","se_063"],["fx",0,"fx_speedline_center_w",0,0],["say","0","Here I come, Alina!",8,""],["show","avg1_162","a","022",null,null,null,0,null,0.0],["w",0.5],["cbg",0,null,0.0,null,"OutQuad",1.0,null,null,null],["bg","phylanis_street_outside_night",0,1.0],["ctl","avg1_162","a","022",null,null,0.0,null,1.0,null,"OutQuad",1.0],["say","0","Her gaze wanders. She searches for a silhouette, waiting for a familiar voice to call her name.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_162","a","006",null,null,null,null,null,"diantou","Linear",0.5],["say","0","But her own soft chuckle breaks the illusion.",0,""],["w",0.5],["say","0","She is no longer Alina. She is Noya, an insignificant existence.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_162","a","004",null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","0","A Noya who wants to become the Noya ==PLAYER_NAME== spoke of...==W== A Noya even ==PLAYER_NAME== doesn't know yet.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_162","a",null,null,null,null,null,null,"lengzhan","Linear",0.5],["goon"],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_162","a","005","sigh",null,null,null,null,"diantou","Linear",0.5],["say","avg3_1331","Sigh... I'm such a fool.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg1_162","a","012",null,null,null,null,0.0,null,"Linear",0.5],["w",0.5],["bg","phylanis_tower_gate_daylight",0,0.75],["cbg",0,null,null,1.1,"Linear",8.0,null,null,null],["w",0.75],["say","avg3_1331","What am I looking for out here? ==SEX1== is right there, inside the Monolith.",0,""],["w",0.5],["trn",0,0,true,true,0.75],["w",0.75],["bg","phylanis_street_outside_night",0,0.0],["stg",0,0.0,0.0,1.0,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["cbg",0,0.0,0.0,1.3,"Linear",0.0,null,null,null],["fx",0,"fx_avg_reminiscence_loop",0,0],["w",0.5],["trn",1,0,false,false,0.75],["w",1.25],["show","avg1_162","a","012",0.3,null,null,0,null,0.0],["show","avg3_100","c","002",0.7,null,null,0,null,0.0],["ctl","avg1_162","a",null,null,null,null,null,1.0,null,"Linear",0.5],["ctl","avg3_100","c",null,null,null,null,null,1.0,null,"Linear",0.5],["w",1.0],["ctl","avg1_162","a",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"Linear",0.5],["say","avg3_1331","But conditioning doesn't happen overnight. Even if you train every day, you need months to see real results.",0,""],["w",0.5],["ctl","avg3_100","c","007",null,null,null,null,null,"lengzhan","Linear",0.5],["ctl","avg1_162","a","002",null,null,null,null,null,"JuGong","Linear",0.5],["say","avg3_1331","Starting tomorrow, come jogging with me at night. We'll mix stamina work with 